        ["Set Variant to Powerline for interlocking chevron segments. Each point slots into the next segment's notch, creating one continuous ribbon. This example uses MdBreadcrumbPathConverter too: selecting an ancestor updates the shared route, while ancestor and current-location colours stay on Material 3 roles."]="把 Variant 设为 Powerline 可获得互相咬合的箭头分段：每个节点嵌入下一段的缺口，连成一条连续的带。本例同时使用 MdBreadcrumbPathConverter：选择上级会更新共享路由，上级与当前位置的颜色仍取自 Material 3 角色。",
        ["Click a parent segment to navigate."]="点击上级分段即可导航。",
        ["ExtraTheme registers MdBreadcrumbPathConverter as a resource named MdBreadcrumbPathConverter. Add ExtraTheme after MaterialTheme, then reference this resource from the ItemsSource binding."]="ExtraTheme 会注册名为 MdBreadcrumbPathConverter 的资源。请在 MaterialTheme 之后添加 ExtraTheme，然后在 ItemsSource 绑定中引用该资源。",
        ["A hover card opens after a deliberate delay on hover or focus. Move from the anchor into the card: it should stay open while either side is attended."]="悬停卡片会在悬停或获得焦点后延迟一段有意的时间再打开。从锚点移入卡片：只要任一侧仍被关注，它就应保持打开。",
        ["Hover or focus the anchor, then move into the card before leaving the whole surface."]="悬停或聚焦锚点，然后在离开整个区域之前移入卡片。",
        ["On desktop this page is a simulation: soft-keyboard avoidance exists for the Android IME, while desktop input methods never cover the window. The strip below stands in for a keyboard inset so MdKeyboardAvoidingHost can be exercised on any platform."]="在桌面端本页是模拟演示：软键盘避让是为 Android 输入法准备的，而桌面输入法不会遮挡窗口。下方的条带用于代替键盘内缩，以便在任何平台上都能验证 MdKeyboardAvoidingHost。",
        ["A real editing engine: inline formatting, tables, images, page view, HTML/JSON/RTF round-trip. The Material theme supplies a theme-aware default text foreground as well as selection, caret and type scale, so unstyled text stays readable in both light and dark modes; the host supplies the surface and outline."]="真正的编辑引擎：行内格式、表格、图片、页面视图、HTML/JSON/RTF 往返。Material 主题提供随主题变化的默认文字前景色以及选区、光标与字体层级，因此未加样式的文本在明暗两种模式下都保持可读；表面与描边由宿主提供。",
        ["Usage: install Md3.Avalonia.RichEditor, then add <themes:MaterialRichEditorTheme /> to Application.Styles after MaterialTheme. The opt-in theme package carries its maintained AvaloniaRichEditor-compatible engine so core packages do not."]="用法：安装 Md3.Avalonia.RichEditor，然后在 Application.Styles 中于 MaterialTheme 之后添加 &lt;themes:MaterialRichEditorTheme /&gt;。该 opt-in 主题包自带维护版的 AvaloniaRichEditor 兼容引擎，核心包不引入。",
