        ["Text editor"]="文本编辑器", ["Open find panel"]="打开查找面板", ["Themed editor"]="已主题化的编辑器",
        ["Hex editor"]="十六进制编辑器", ["Toggle column headers"]="切换列表头", ["Themed hex view"]="已主题化的十六进制视图",
        ["AvaloniaEdit wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.AvaloniaEdit theme: line numbers, find and replace, completion, and the Material caret and selection ink. No Fluent resources anywhere in the app."]="AvaloniaEdit 配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.AvaloniaEdit 主题：行号、查找替换、补全，以及 Material 的光标与选区配色；整个应用不需要 Fluent 资源。",
        ["The theme re-templates TextEditor, TextArea, the search panel and the completion list, and styles the controls the editor creates for itself with keyed Md.Comp.AvaloniaEdit.* themes, so the rest of the application keeps its own control themes."]="该主题重新模板化了 TextEditor、TextArea、查找面板和补全列表，并用带键的 Md.Comp.AvaloniaEdit.* 主题为编辑器自建的内部控件换肤，因此应用其余部分仍保留自己的控件主题。",
        ["AvaloniaHex wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.AvaloniaHex theme: offset, hex and ASCII columns on a Material surface, drawn with the library's selection wash, caret and header colours."]="AvaloniaHex 配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.AvaloniaHex 主题：Material 表面上的偏移量、十六进制与 ASCII 三列，并使用本库统一的选区配色、光标与表头颜色。",
        ["The editor brings its own Material chrome — surfaceContainerLow surface, outlineVariant outline, ExtraSmall corner and MdScrollViewer scrollbars — so it can be dropped straight into a page. Offsets and column headers are onSurfaceVariant, bytes are onSurface, the header strip sits on surfaceContainerHigh and the current line on surfaceContainerHighest."]="编辑器自带 Material 外观——surfaceContainerLow 表面、outlineVariant 描边、ExtraSmall 圆角与 MdScrollViewer 滚动条——可以直接放进页面。偏移量与列表头用 onSurfaceVariant，字节用 onSurface，表头条带用 surfaceContainerHigh，当前行用 surfaceContainerHighest。",
        ["Docking"]="停靠布局", ["Themed dock"]="已主题化的停靠布局",
        ["Dock wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.Dock theme: tool panes, document tabs, splitters, drop targets, chrome buttons and the drag preview all read Material tokens. No Fluent resources are needed, light and dark follow the Material theme variant."]="Dock 配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.Dock 主题：工具窗格、文档标签、分隔条、拖放目标、标题栏按钮与拖拽预览全部读取 Material tokens；不需要 Fluent 资源，明暗跟随 Material 主题变体。",
        ["Drag a tab to another edge to see the Material drop targets, and hover the document tabs to see the active-tab container and the state layers. The theme re-colours Dock's own accents and tabs and keeps Dock's templates and part names, so every layout Dock can build keeps working."]="把标签拖到另一条边即可看到 Material 拖放目标，悬停文档标签可以看到选中容器与状态层。该主题只重写 Dock 自己的强调色与标签配色，并保留 Dock 的模板与部件名，因此 Dock 能搭建的任何布局都照常工作。",
        ["Tool panes, splitter grips and the drop targets are all Material: OutlineVariant borders, SurfaceContainer headers and a Primary indicator."]="工具窗格、分隔条把手与拖放目标全部 Material 化：outlineVariant 描边、surfaceContainer 表头与 primary 指示器。",
        ["MaterialDockTheme maps the 44 Dock accent, surface, tab and chrome brushes onto Md.Sys.Color tokens; the active document tab is a Primary container with OnPrimary ink."]="MaterialDockTheme 把 Dock 的 44 个强调色、表面、标签与标题栏画刷映射到 Md.Sys.Color tokens；选中的文档标签是 primary 容器配 onPrimary 文字。",
        ["Dock keeps owning its templates; this package owns only the token values, so a Dock upgrade cannot drift from a forked template."]="模板仍然由 Dock 自己维护，这个包只提供 token 取值，因此升级 Dock 不会与复刻的模板产生偏差。",
        ["Add the theme after MaterialTheme and keep using Dock as usual - the package carries Dock.Avalonia and Dock.Avalonia.Themes.Fluent, and DockFluentTheme must not be included as well. Registering it on a page, as this demo does, keeps the implicit Button theme it brings inside the dock's subtree."]="把主题加在 MaterialTheme 之后即可照常使用 Dock——该包自带 Dock.Avalonia 与 Dock.Avalonia.Themes.Fluent，且不要同时引入 DockFluentTheme。本页把主题注册在页面自己的样式里，而不是应用级别。",
        ["Draggable tabs"]="可拖拽标签页",
        ["Tabalonia wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.Tabalonia theme: reorder a tab by dragging it, tear one out into its own window, or drop it on the other strip. The strip, the tab containers and both icon buttons all read Material tokens, and no Fluent resources are needed."]="Tabalonia 配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.Tabalonia 主题：拖动标签即可重新排序，也可以把标签撕出为独立窗口，或拖放到另一条标签条上。标签条、标签容器与两个图标按钮全部读取 Material tokens，且不需要 Fluent 资源。",
        ["Themed strips"]="已主题化的标签条",
        ["The idle tab is an onSurfaceVariant label on the surface, hover is the standard onSurface state layer, and the selected tab is a Primary container with OnPrimary ink - the same mapping the Dock theme uses for its document tabs. The second strip pins its first tab, so that one cannot be dragged or closed."]="未选中的标签是表面上的 onSurfaceVariant 文字，悬停为标准 onSurface 状态层，选中的标签是 primary 容器配 onPrimary 文字——与 Dock 主题用于文档标签的映射一致。第二条标签条固定了它的第一个标签，因此该标签不能拖动或关闭。",
        ["Pinned"]="已固定",
        ["Add a tab"]="添加标签页",
        ["Close the selected tab"]="关闭选中的标签页",
        ["Register the theme after MaterialTheme and keep using TabsControl as usual. It replaces Tabalonia's CustomTheme and FluentTheme and needs neither of them nor Avalonia's FluentTheme; ItemsSource must implement IList, and NewItemFactory decides what the add button appends."]="在 MaterialTheme 之后注册该主题，然后照常使用 TabsControl。它会替代 Tabalonia 的 CustomTheme 与 FluentTheme，既不需要这两个，也不需要 Avalonia 的 FluentTheme；ItemsSource 必须实现 IList，添加按钮追加什么内容由 NewItemFactory 决定。",
        ["Tokens"]="令牌",
        ["Notes"]="笔记",
        ["Material tokens drive this pane: the strip sits on Surface, the selected tab is a Primary container with OnPrimary ink, and hover is the 0.08 onSurface state layer."]="本窗格由 Material tokens 驱动：标签条位于 surface 上，选中标签是 primary 容器配 onPrimary 文字，悬停则是 0.08 的 onSurface 状态层。",
        ["Added from the strip's own add button."]="由标签条自带的添加按钮添加。",
        ["Markdown"]="Markdown 文档",
        ["Markdown.Avalonia documents wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.Markdown style collection: headings, prose, links, lists, quotes, code blocks, tables, notes and rules are all drawn from the Material type scale and colour roles, and light/dark follow the core MaterialTheme variant."]="Markdown.Avalonia 文档配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.Markdown 样式集合：标题、正文、链接、列表、引用、代码块、表格、提示与分隔线全部取自 Material 的字阶与颜色角色，明暗跟随核心 MaterialTheme 变体。",
        ["Rendered document"]="渲染结果",
        ["The collection is built inside this page and assigned to this one viewer, so nothing outside it changes - a viewer whose MarkdownStyle is left alone keeps Markdown.Avalonia's own look."]="该集合在本页内构造并只赋给这一个查看器，因此外部不受影响——未设置 MarkdownStyle 的查看器仍保持 Markdown.Avalonia 自带外观。",
        ["Select text in the document to see the Material selection tint; it is Md.Sys.Color.PrimarySelection.Brush, the same wash the editor, hex viewer and text field themes use, and without it the viewer falls back to a cyan selection."]="在文档中选中文字可以看到 Material 的选区色：它就是 Md.Sys.Color.PrimarySelection.Brush，与编辑器、十六进制查看器和输入框主题所用的一致；没有它时查看器会退回青色选区。",
        ["This is the one Material theme that is not registered in Application.Styles: MarkdownScrollViewer chooses the style collection it renders with itself and inserts it into its own Styles, and Markdown.Avalonia keeps its five built-in collections closed to third parties, so the collection is assigned to the viewer's MarkdownStyle property instead - one instance per viewer."]="这是唯一不注册到 Application.Styles 的 Material 主题：MarkdownScrollViewer 自己挑选渲染用的样式集合并把它插进自己的 Styles，而 Markdown.Avalonia 的五个内置集合对第三方是封闭的，所以这里的做法是把它赋给查看器的 MarkdownStyle 属性——每个查看器一个实例。",
        ["Mapping"]="映射",
        ["LiveCharts2 charts"]="LiveCharts2 图表",
        ["ScottPlot charts"]="ScottPlot 图表",
        ["ScottPlot charts wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.ScottPlot theme: the plot is a Material surface, axes and grids take the theme's inks and type scale, the legend is a surface container, and the series walk the same eight Material roles the LiveCharts2 theme uses."]="ScottPlot 图表配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.ScottPlot 主题：绘图区是一块 Material 表面，坐标轴与网格采用主题的墨色与字阶，图例是一个表面容器，系列走的是与 LiveCharts2 主题相同的八个 Material 角色。",
        ["Both controls below are stock ScottPlot AvaPlot views. The page calls the theme once per control and the theme keeps them in step with the application's light/dark switch - ScottPlot writes colours into a plot when they are set, so a themed plot does not re-resolve them the way an Avalonia style would."]="下面两个控件都是原样的 ScottPlot AvaPlot 视图。页面为每个控件调用一次主题，主题随后让它们跟随应用明暗切换——ScottPlot 只在设置时把颜色写进绘图对象，因此已主题化的图表不会像 Avalonia 样式那样自行重新解析颜色。",
        ["The signal curves, the bars, the grid, the axis inks and the legend are all drawn from Md.Sys.* tokens; the bars take the palette's first role and each curve the next one, wrapping like ScottPlot's own palettes."]="信号曲线、柱条、网格、坐标轴墨色与图例全部取自 Md.Sys.* 令牌；柱条取调色板的第一个角色，每条曲线依次取下一个，循环方式与 ScottPlot 自带调色板一致。",
        ["Eight Material roles carry the series palette, in the same order the LiveCharts2 theme walks them: the first four give a palette of four hues the way ScottPlot's own palettes do, and the remaining four are further tones of the same accent hues, so a chart with more than four series still reads as Material instead of inventing colours."]="系列调色板由八个 Material 角色组成，顺序与 LiveCharts2 主题一致：前四个与 ScottPlot 自带调色板一样提供四种色相，后四个是同色相的更多色调，因此超过四个系列时仍然像 Material，而不会出现随意编造的颜色。",
        ["ScottPlot has no per-control styles either: a plot carries its own colours, so there is nothing to register in Application.Styles and nothing that could leak into a chart this package was not asked to style. Follow() themes a control for the variant it actually has and keeps it in step; an application that draws plots off screen can apply the rules to a Plot directly."]="ScottPlot 同样没有针对单个控件的样式：绘图对象自己保存颜色，因此 `Application.Styles` 里没有任何东西可注册，也不会有样式泄漏到本包未被要求处理的图表上。`Follow()` 按控件当前的实际变体应用主题并让二者保持同步；离屏绘制图表的应用可以直接把规则应用到 `Plot` 上。",
        ["Figure and data background are the same Material surface, so a chart inside a card blends with the card. Axes, their names and the title carry the OnSurfaceVariant ink, which colors the frame, the tick marks, the tick labels and the axis names in one call. The grid is a single OutlineVariant line at major ticks and minor lines are switched off, and the legend is a SurfaceContainerHigh panel with the same soft OutlineVariant outline a Material card uses, so it reads as a container floating over the data rather than the default white box. Type runs on the same roles the LiveCharts2 theme uses: TitleMedium for the chart title, LabelLarge for axis names and legend entries, LabelMedium for tick labels, all in the family the Md.Sys.Typeface.Plain token names. Series take the eight-role palette through the plot's own plottable adder."]="图形背景与数据区背景是同一块 Material 表面，因此卡片里的图表与卡片融为一体。坐标轴、轴名与标题使用 OnSurfaceVariant 墨色，一次调用即覆盖边框、刻度线、刻度标签与轴名。网格只在主刻度上画一条 OutlineVariant 线，次网格关闭；图例是 SurfaceContainerHigh 面板并带 Material 卡片那种柔和的 OutlineVariant 描边，读起来像浮在数据之上的容器，而不是默认的白色方块。字体沿用 LiveCharts2 主题的角色：图表标题 TitleMedium、轴名与图例 LabelLarge、刻度标签 LabelMedium，字体族取自 Md.Sys.Typeface.Plain 令牌。系列通过绘图对象自身的 plottable adder 采用八角色调色板。",
        ["This is the second Material theme in the repository that is not an Avalonia style collection at all - there is no Styles or ControlTheme in the package, only a plot-level entry point. ScottPlot keeps the axis frames, tick generation, layout and interaction exactly as it ships; the theme writes colours, sizes and the palette, and a plot that is left alone keeps ScottPlot's own defaults. The theme reads Md.Sys.Color.* for the variant it is asked for, so light/dark follow the application; an application that does not register MaterialTheme gets the M3 baseline values the package carries instead. MdChart in the core package stays provider neutral and keeps drawing through whichever chart engine an application picks."]="这是仓库里第二个完全不是 Avalonia 样式集合的 Material 主题——包里没有 Styles 也没有 ControlTheme，只有绘图对象级的入口。ScottPlot 的坐标轴边框、刻度生成、布局与交互保持原样；主题只写颜色、字号与调色板，未被处理的绘图对象仍是 ScottPlot 自己的默认外观。主题按被要求的变体读取 Md.Sys.Color.*，因此明暗跟随应用；未注册 MaterialTheme 的应用则使用包内自带的 M3 基线取值。核心包中的 MdChart 保持与绘图引擎无关，继续用应用选定的图表引擎绘制。",
        ["Property grid"]="属性网格",
        ["A property grid wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.PropertyGrid theme. The grid sets no colours of its own: it lays out templates and hosts plain Avalonia controls, so this theme hands each of those controls a Material control theme - fields, checkboxes, combo boxes, spinners, sliders, date and time pickers, expanders, menus and tooltips - without replacing any native control theme elsewhere in the application."]="属性网格配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.PropertyGrid 主题。网格自身不设置任何颜色：它只负责布局模板并承载原生 Avalonia 控件，因此本主题为这些控件逐个提供 Material 控件主题——字段、复选框、组合框、微调器、滑块、日期与时间选择器、展开器、菜单与工具提示——同时不会替换应用其他位置的任何原生控件主题。",
        ["Themed grid"]="已主题化的网格",
        ["Filter with the field at the top, narrow the list to a category with the chips below it, and open the options menu from the button beside the field. Categories are Material expanders, the name/value divider is an outlineVariant rule that turns primary while it is dragged, and the property list scrolls on the core Material scrollbar."]="用顶部的输入框过滤，用下方的标签块把列表收窄到某个分类，用输入框旁的按钮打开选项菜单。分类是 Material 展开器，名称/值分隔线是 outlineVariant 细线、拖动时变为 primary，属性列表滚动在核心的 Material 滚动条上。",
        ["Every cell editor in that grid is a plain Avalonia control the grid built itself: string cells are Material filled fields, numeric cells are filled fields with Material spinners, booleans are Material checkboxes, enums are Material combo boxes, collections are Material list editors, and the date and time cells open the control's own wheel flyout inside a Material surface card."]="网格里每个单元格编辑器都是网格自己创建的原生 Avalonia 控件：字符串单元格是 Material 填充字段，数值单元格是带 Material 微调器的填充字段，布尔值是 Material 复选框，枚举是 Material 组合框，集合是 Material 列表编辑器，日期与时间单元格则在 Material 表面卡片里打开控件自带的滚轮浮层。",
        ["How it stays local"]="如何保持局部生效",
        ["The theme reaches the cells the same way it reaches the chrome: one style per native type, each selector requiring a PropertyGrid ancestor, each handing that type one of the Md.Comp.PropertyGrid.* control themes. That is what keeps the package opt-in - a TextBox anywhere else in the application still has no control theme of its own, exactly as before this package was added, and the grid needs no FluentTheme."]="主题触达单元格的方式与触达外壳的方式相同：每种原生类型一条样式，每个选择器都要求存在 PropertyGrid 祖先，每条样式把 Md.Comp.PropertyGrid.* 中的一个控件主题交给该类型。这正是本包保持 opt-in 的原因——应用其他位置的 TextBox 仍然没有自己的控件主题，与添加本包之前完全一致，而且网格不需要 FluentTheme。",
        ["Two hairlines stay upstream's: the 0.5 DIP Gray border the grid's own templates draw around the list, radio-button and toggle-group editors, and the same border its expandable-object factory sets from C#. Both are local values, so no style can reach them, and this package does not fork the grid's eleven embedded control styles just to repaint them. Colour cells keep Avalonia's own ColorPicker, whose style sheets the grid already loads for its own subtree."]="有两条细线仍属于上游：网格自身模板为列表、单选按钮组与切换按钮组编辑器绘制的 0.5 DIP 灰色边框，以及其可展开对象工厂在 C# 中设置的同一条边框。两者都是本地值，任何样式都触达不到；本包也不会仅仅为了重绘它们而复刻上游内嵌的十一个控件样式。颜色单元格保留 Avalonia 自带的 ColorPicker——网格本来就为自己的子树加载了它的样式表。",
        ["Node editor"]="节点编辑器",
        ["A node editor wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.NodifyM theme. The canvas is a Material surface ruled with outlineVariant grid lines, nodes are surface containers with a secondary container header, input pins are secondary containers and output pins primary containers, so the two ends of a wire are distinguishable without reading a label - and the alignment guides and the selection frame use the same primary."]="节点编辑器配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.NodifyM 主题。画布是一块 Material 表面，用 outlineVariant 网格线划分；节点是带 secondary container 标题栏的表面容器，输入引脚是 secondary container、输出引脚是 primary container，因此一根连线的两端无需看标签即可区分——框选、对齐参考线与选中边框用的是同一个 primary。",
        ["Drag a node to move it, drag from a pin onto another to wire them, drag on empty canvas to marquee-select, and scroll to zoom. The minimap in the corner is the same editor's own control, wearing the same brushes."]="拖动节点即可移动，从一个引脚拖到另一个引脚即可连线，在空白画布上拖动即可框选，滚动即可缩放。角落里的小地图是同一个编辑器自带的控件，使用同一套画刷。",
        ["Every colour in that editor comes from Md.Sys.* tokens: nothing on the controls was set, and the page's own templates read the same brush keys the package overrides rather than picking colours of their own."]="编辑器里的每种颜色都来自 Md.Sys.* 令牌：控件上没有设置任何颜色，页面自己的模板读取的也是本包覆盖的那些画刷键，而不是自行挑颜色。",
        ["The theme is a Styles collection that style-includes NodifyM's eleven per-control style sheets and answers the brush keys those templates read from an accent dictionary of ours, so the pinned package keeps owning its templates, its part names and its converters, and only the values change. Every one of those keys is mapped onto Md.Sys.Color.*, which is why light and dark follow the core theme variant and the dictionary carries no variants of its own."]="本主题是一个 Styles 集合：它 style-include NodifyM 的十一个单控件样式表，并用我们自己的配色字典来应答那些模板读取的画刷键，因此被固定的上游包继续拥有它的模板、部件名与转换器，只有取值发生变化。这些键全部映射到 Md.Sys.Color.*，这正是明暗两种变体跟随核心主题变体、而该字典自身不携带任何变体的原因。",
        ["NodifyM's controls are all its own types - Node, Connector, Connection and friends - so there is no native Avalonia control here for the theme to be careful about, and registering it application-wide changes nothing else in the app. The values upstream sets as literals - a node's white ink, the Azure behind its items, a group's four inline colours and the grid rule's grey - are set again by the theme; the node's 3 DIP corner radius, baked into its template, stays upstream's."]="NodifyM 的控件全部是它自己的类型——Node、Connector、Connection 等——因此这里没有需要主题格外小心的原生 Avalonia 控件，即使在应用级注册也不会改变应用中的其他任何东西。上游以字面量设置的那些取值——节点的白色前景、其条目背后的 Azure、分组节点的四种内联颜色以及网格线的灰色——都由主题重新设置；而写死在节点模板里的 3 DIP 圆角仍然归上游所有。",
        ["Minimap"]="小地图",
        ["A Mapsui map wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.Mapsui theme: the canvas is a Material surface, a layer nobody has styled is drawn with the theme's vector style, labels are surface container chips typeset from the type scale, and a thematic layer takes the same eight Material roles the chart providers use."]="一张配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.Mapsui 主题的 Mapsui 地图：画布是一块 Material 表面，无人设过样式的图层用主题的矢量样式绘制，标注是依字号阶梯排版的 surface container 小片，专题图层则取用与图表提供者相同的八个 Material 角色。",
        ["Themed map"]="已主题化的地图",
        ["The control below is a stock Mapsui MapControl. The page calls the theme once and the theme keeps the map in step with the application's light/dark switch - Mapsui writes colours into a map when they are set, so a themed map does not re-resolve them the way an Avalonia style would. The page rebuilds the layer's own styles for the variant too, for the same reason. Its four points live in memory: this page never fetches a tile, so it renders the same offline as it does online."]="下面是一个原样的 Mapsui MapControl。页面只调用一次主题，此后主题让地图跟随应用的明暗切换——Mapsui 在赋值时就把颜色写进地图，因此已主题化的地图不会像 Avalonia 样式那样重新解析。页面同样会为当前变体重建图层自己的样式，理由相同。它的四个点保存在内存中：本页从不拉取瓦片，因此离线与在线渲染结果相同。",
        ["The canvas, the markers' fill and hairline outline and the label chips all come from Md.Sys.* tokens. A marker is the accent at twelve percent with an Outline boundary, which is what the theme's vector style writes; a label is a SurfaceContainer chip with the soft OutlineVariant border and the ExtraSmall corner a Material badge carries."]="画布、标记的填充与细描边以及标注小片全部来自 Md.Sys.* 令牌。标记是 12% 的强调色配 Outline 边界，这正是主题矢量样式写入的取值；标注是带柔和 OutlineVariant 边框、以及 Material 徽标所用 ExtraSmall 圆角的 SurfaceContainer 小片。",
        ["Layer palette"]="图层配色",
        ["Eight Material roles carry the palette a thematic map takes its classes from, in the same order the ScottPlot and LiveCharts2 themes walk them: the first four give a palette of four hues, and the remaining four are further tones of the same accent hues, so a map with more than four classes still reads as Material instead of inventing colours."]="八个 Material 角色构成专题地图分级取色的配色，顺序与 ScottPlot、LiveCharts2 主题一致：前四个给出四种色相，后四个是同一批强调色的其他层次，因此分级超过四类的地图仍然读作 Material，而不是自造颜色。",
        ["The canvas is Surface, so a map inside a card blends with the card. A layer nobody has styled is given the theme's vector style: a polygon boundary is a hairline in Outline, a line feature a heavier stroke in the OnSurfaceVariant ink, and a region is filled with Primary at twelve percent - the tint a Material container lays over a surface, mixed here because Mapsui's brush takes a colour rather than an opacity. A label is a SurfaceContainer chip with an OutlineVariant border, the ExtraSmall corner radius and OnSurface ink, typeset at LabelMedium in the family the Md.Sys.Typeface.Plain token names. A layer whose style was chosen keeps it: every layer Mapsui creates starts with a grey outline and a white fill, and it is that default the theme answers."]="画布是 Surface，因此卡片内的地图与卡片融为一体。无人设过样式的图层会得到主题的矢量样式：多边形边界是 Outline 的细线，线要素是 OnSurfaceVariant 墨色下更粗的一笔，区域则以 12% 的 Primary 填充——那是 Material 容器铺在表面上的淡色，之所以在此处调好，是因为 Mapsui 的画刷只接受颜色而非不透明度。标注是带 OutlineVariant 边框、ExtraSmall 圆角与 OnSurface 墨色的 SurfaceContainer 小片，以 LabelMedium、用 Md.Sys.Typeface.Plain 令牌指定的字族排版。样式是别人挑过的图层则保持原样：Mapsui 建的每个图层都自带灰色描边与白色填充的默认样式，主题应答的正是这个默认值。",
        ["Mapsui has no per-control styles either: a map carries its own colours, so there is nothing to register in Application.Styles and nothing that could leak into a map this package was not asked to style. Follow() themes the map a control draws for the variant it actually has and keeps it in step; the vector and label styles are handed to a layer, because a layer's style is its content's business and a style somebody chose is left alone."]="Mapsui 同样没有针对单个控件的样式：地图自己保存颜色，因此 `Application.Styles` 里没有任何东西可注册，也不会有样式泄漏到本包未被要求处理的地图上。`Follow()` 按控件当前的实际变体为其绘制的地图应用主题并让二者保持同步；矢量样式与标注样式则是交给图层的——图层样式属于其内容，别人挑过的样式不会被改动。",
        ["This is the third Material theme in the repository that is not an Avalonia style collection at all - there is no Styles or ControlTheme in the package, only a map-level entry point, the way the ScottPlot and LiveCharts2 providers work. Mapsui keeps its projection, tile fetching, navigation, hit testing and animation exactly as it ships; the theme writes colours, sizes and the palette. The theme reads Md.Sys.Color.* for the variant it is asked for, so light and dark follow the application; an application that does not register MaterialTheme gets the M3 baseline values the package carries instead. Core Mapsui draws lines and polygons through Mapsui.Nts, which this package does not depend on, so the demo here is points and labels."]="这是仓库中第三个完全不是 Avalonia 样式集合的 Material 主题——包内没有 Styles 或 ControlTheme，只有一个地图级入口，做法与 ScottPlot、LiveCharts2 提供者相同。Mapsui 的投影、瓦片拉取、导航、命中测试与动画全部保持出厂行为；主题只写颜色、尺寸与配色。主题按被要求的变体读取 Md.Sys.Color.*，因此明暗跟随应用；未注册 MaterialTheme 的应用则改用本包自带的 M3 基准值。核心 Mapsui 通过 Mapsui.Nts 绘制线与多边形，而本包不依赖它，所以这里的示例是点与标注。",
        ["LiveCharts2 charts wearing the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.LiveCharts2 theme: series take the Material palette, axes and grids the theme's inks and type scale, tooltips and legends the inverse-surface card, and light/dark follow the core MaterialTheme variant."]="LiveCharts2 图表配上 opt-in 的 Md3.Avalonia.LiveCharts2 主题：系列采用 Material 调色板，坐标轴与网格采用主题的墨色与字阶，工具提示与图例是反相表面卡片，明暗跟随核心 MaterialTheme 变体。",
        ["Themed charts"]="已主题化的图表",
        ["Both charts below are stock LiveCharts2 views: nothing on the controls was set, the fill, stroke, marker and corner rules all arrive from the one theme the process configured."]="下面两张图都是原样的 LiveCharts2 控件：控件上什么都没设置，填充、描边、数据点与圆角规则全部来自进程配置的那个主题。",
        ["The line and column series, the donut, both legends and both tooltips are drawn from Md.Sys.* tokens; hover a point to see the tooltip as a Material inverse-surface card with a drop shadow."]="折线与柱状系列、环形图、两个图例与两个工具提示都取自 Md.Sys.* tokens；把指针移到数据点上可以看到工具提示是带投影的 Material 反相表面卡片。",
        ["Series palette"]="系列调色板",
        ["Eight Material roles carry the series palette, in this order: the first four give a palette of four hues the way LiveCharts' own palette does, and the remaining four are further tones of the same accent hues, so a chart with more than four series still reads as Material instead of inventing colours."]="系列调色板由八个 Material 角色组成，顺序如下：前四个与 LiveCharts 自带调色板一样提供四种色相，后四个是同色相的更多色调，因此超过四个系列时仍然像 Material，而不会出现随意编造的颜色。",
        ["LiveCharts has no per-control styles: every chart resolves its look from the one theme held by LiveCharts.DefaultSettings, so the theme is configured once, at startup, before the first chart view exists. Adding it on top of LiveCharts' own default theme keeps its tooltip and legend factories and its animations."]="LiveCharts 没有针对单个控件的样式：每张图的外观都来自 LiveCharts.DefaultSettings 里那唯一一个主题，因此在启动时、在第一个图表控件出现之前配置一次即可。把它叠加在 LiveCharts 自带默认主题之上，可以保留其工具提示与图例工厂以及动画。",
        ["Axes take the LabelMedium size and the OnSurfaceVariant ink, grid lines are OutlineVariant and the horizontal-only rule LiveCharts draws stays as it is. A line series is a 3 DIP stroke with 8 DIP markers ringed in the series colour over the surface, and upstream's area fill is cleared so a line chart reads as a line chart. Columns grow with a 4 DIP rounded end and sit 6 DIP apart, which is the one place the geometry moves away from upstream; a stacked bar keeps square corners so the segments read as one bar. A pie or donut is separated by the surface showing through, a gauge is a SurfaceContainerHighest track with a Primary indicator, and candlesticks take the third accent for rising and the error role for falling instead of upstream's green and red. Tooltips and legends are the inverse-surface card with the OnSurfaceVariant ink at LabelLarge, and a chart's canvas is cleared to the card's surface so a chart inside a card blends with it."]="坐标轴使用 LabelMedium 字号与 OnSurfaceVariant 墨色，网格线是 OutlineVariant，LiveCharts 只画水平线这一点保持不变。折线系列是 3 DIP 描边、8 DIP 数据点，点外圈是系列色、内里是表面色；上游的面积填充被清空，让折线图就是折线图。柱状以 4 DIP 圆角收尾、间距 6 DIP，这是唯一偏离上游几何的地方；堆叠柱保持直角，好让各段读起来是一根柱子。饼图或环形图靠表面色透出分隔，仪表是 SurfaceContainerHighest 轨道配 Primary 指示弧，K 线用第三个强调色表示上涨、用 error 表示下跌，取代上游的绿与红。工具提示与图例是反相表面卡片，墨色为 OnSurfaceVariant、字号 LabelLarge；图表画布清屏为卡片表面色，因此卡片里的图表与卡片融为一体。",
        ["This is the one Material theme that is not an Avalonia style collection at all - LiveCharts' only seam is its global settings, and this package contains no Styles or ControlTheme that could reach an Avalonia style tree. A chart view's own overrides (its ChartTheme, its tooltip and legend paints) still win over the theme, and a series that sets a paint itself keeps it. The theme reads Md.Sys.Color.* for the variant each chart draws in, so light/dark follow the application; an application that does not register MaterialTheme gets the M3 baseline values the package carries instead. MdChart in the core package stays provider neutral and keeps drawing through whichever chart engine an application picks."]="这是唯一完全不是 Avalonia 样式集合的 Material 主题——LiveCharts 唯一的口子就是它的全局设置，这个包里没有任何能进入 Avalonia 样式树的 Styles 或 ControlTheme。图表控件自身的覆盖（它的 ChartTheme、工具提示与图例画刷）依旧优先于主题，系列自己设置的画刷也会保留。主题按每张图绘制时所在的变体读取 Md.Sys.Color.*，因此明暗跟随应用；未注册 MaterialTheme 的应用则使用包内自带的 M3 基线取值。核心包中的 MdChart 保持与绘图引擎无关，继续用应用选定的图表引擎绘制。",
        ["Every selector of the pinned package's own FluentTheme collection is re-tokenized with the same shape: prose is OnSurfaceVariant on Surface, headings and code are OnSurface, links are Primary and switch to Tertiary on hover, the blockquote bar is Primary, table and divider rules are OutlineVariant, code blocks sit on SurfaceContainerLow, and notes, table headers and inline code use SurfaceContainerHighest. Sizes come from Md.Sys.TypeScale - HeadlineLarge for h1 down to TitleSmall for h6, BodyLarge for prose, BodyMedium for code and table cells, LabelLarge for table headers - and headings follow the M3 role weights instead of Fluent's Light: Regular down to TitleLarge, Medium for TitleMedium, TitleSmall and table headers. Layout follows upstream except where Material has a shape of its own: the code block is a SurfaceContainerLow card with an 8 DIP radius and 12/10 DIP padding instead of two hairlines, table cells get 10/6 DIP padding instead of 2, and the Error marker on an unhandled ::: container is a 3 DIP frame."]="固定版本自带 FluentTheme 集合的每一条选择器都按同样的形状重写成 token：正文是 Surface 上的 OnSurfaceVariant，标题与代码是 OnSurface，链接是 Primary、悬停切换为 Tertiary，引用条是 Primary，表格线与分隔线是 OutlineVariant，代码块位于 SurfaceContainerLow，提示、表头与行内代码使用 SurfaceContainerHighest。字号取自 Md.Sys.TypeScale——h1 用 HeadlineLarge 一路到 h6 的 TitleSmall、正文 BodyLarge、代码与表格单元 BodyMedium、表头 LabelLarge——标题按 M3 各角色的字重而非 Fluent 的 Light：到 TitleLarge 为止是 Regular，TitleMedium、TitleSmall 与表头是 Medium。布局基本沿用上游，只在 Material 自有形状处改动：代码块是 SurfaceContainerLow 卡片、8 圆角与 12/10 内边距（取代上下两条细线），表格单元格内边距 10/6（上游为 2），未处理 ::: 容器的 Error 标记是 3 宽的边框。",

        // Defect #29 sweep (2026-10-13): every prose TextBlock - the h1, h2, h3 and body classes -
        // now has an entry. scripts/check-gallery-localization.py measures this and fails on a
        // duplicate key, which would silently kill whichever of two translations came first.
        // Sample data, colour role names and shortcuts are deliberately absent: translating them
        // would be wrong, and the checker lists them separately rather than as a gap.
        ["1 · Reference"]="1 · 引用",
        ["2 · Install the opt-in resources"]="2 · 安装可选资源",
        ["3 · Build a screen"]="3 · 构建一个界面",
        ["108 indexed pages. Every entry below opens its own page; MdGalleryIndexTests fails the build if any of them stops resolving."]="108 个已索引页面。下列每一项都会打开自己的页面；任一页面无法解析时 MdGalleryIndexTests 会让构建失败。",
        ["A Material banner carries a persistent message with up to two actions. It stays until an action is taken rather than timing out like a snackbar."]="Material 横幅承载持续存在的消息，最多带两个操作。它会一直保留直到用户处理，而不像 Snackbar 那样超时消失。",
        ["A Material data table with sortable column headers. Sorting is reported to the host, which owns the ordering of ItemsSource."]="带可排序列头的 Material 数据表格。排序结果上报给宿主，由宿主负责 ItemsSource 的排列。",
        ["A Material text field with a stepper. The increment and decrement targets are centred on the field's input row, so they stay aligned when supporting text adds height underneath."]="带步进器的 Material 文本框。增减按钮以输入框的输入行为中心，因此在下方出现辅助文本增加高度时仍保持对齐。",
        ["A cascading picker for a hierarchy. The selection is reported as the full path from root to leaf, not just the leaf."]="面向层级结构的级联选择器。选择结果以从根到叶的完整路径上报，而不只是叶子节点。",
        ["A column-balanced panel for uneven cards. Each tile is a real target, so the layout demonstrates dense dashboard reflow rather than decorative blocks."]="面向不等高卡片的分栏平衡面板。每个磁贴都是真实目标，因此该布局展示的是密集仪表板的重排，而不是装饰性色块。",
        ["A custom Material-styled color workflow built from official surface, text field, connected button, slider, state, and accessibility guidance. Material 3 and Flutter do not define a first-party ColorPicker component."]="基于官方的表面、文本框、连体按钮、滑块、状态与无障碍指引构建的 Material 风格取色流程。Material 3 与 Flutter 都没有定义一方 ColorPicker 组件。",
        ["A data table that pages its rows, reporting the page index and first row index as the user moves through them."]="对行分页的数据表格，随用户翻页上报页码与首行索引。",
        ["A filled container creates quiet visual grouping."]="填充容器形成安静的视觉分组。",
        ["A focus traversal group cycles with Tab, a shortcut scope binds Ctrl+Shift+S while the group holds focus, and MdHero flies an element between two positions."]="焦点遍历组用 Tab 循环；快捷键作用域在该组持有焦点时绑定 Ctrl+Shift+S；MdHero 让元素在两个位置之间飞行。",
        ["A full-surface outcome: empty, success, or error, with one primary action. Running the action here switches the surface from empty to success."]="占满整面的结果视图：空态、成功或错误，并带一个主操作。在此运行该操作会把界面从空态切换为成功态。",
        ["A hover card opens after a deliberate delay on hover or focus, so a pointer crossing the anchor does not flash it open."]="悬停卡片在悬停或聚焦后经过刻意的延迟才打开，因此指针掠过锚点不会闪现。",
        ["A list row that reveals actions when swiped either way. Ctrl+Left, Ctrl+Right and Escape drive it from the keyboard."]="向任意方向滑动即可露出操作的列表行。Ctrl+Left、Ctrl+Right 与 Escape 可用键盘驱动。",
        ["A message list with selection, quoting, retry and attachments surfaced as commands and events. The provider behind it is yours."]="消息列表，将选择、引用、重试与附件以命令和事件的形式暴露，底层数据提供方由你实现。",
        ["A month calendar with single or range selection and a badge provider for marking dates that carry something."]="支持单选与范围选择的月历，并可通过徽标提供器标记有内容的日期。",
        ["A panel that plays its children in on a stagger, so a group of tiles arrives as a sequence instead of all at once."]="让子元素错开入场的布局面板，使一组磁贴按顺序出现而不是一次性全部出现。",
        ["A popover is a transient anchored surface. It closes on an outside click, Escape, a page scroll, or when another popup opens."]="弹出框是临时锚定表面。点击外部、按 Escape、页面滚动或打开另一个弹出层时都会关闭。",
        ["A provider-agnostic store keeps picker values across a teardown, so a process death or a navigation away can be recovered from."]="与提供方无关的存储会跨销毁保留选择器的值，因此进程被杀或导航离开后仍可恢复。",
        ["A provider-neutral chart: it renders the series you give it and reports the hovered point. No chart engine is bundled."]="与图表引擎无关的图表：它渲染你提供的序列并上报悬停的数据点，不内置任何图表引擎。",
        ["A real editing engine: inline formatting, tables, images, page view, HTML/JSON/RTF round-trip. The Material theme sets its surface, outline, shape, type scale, selection and caret from the same tokens as the rest of the library and leaves the control's own template alone, so it keeps working across upstream releases."]="真正的编辑引擎：行内格式、表格、图片、页面视图、HTML/JSON/RTF 往返。Material 主题使用与库其余部分相同的令牌设置其表面、描边、形状、字号层级、选区与光标，并且不改动控件自身的模板，因此上游发版后仍可继续工作。",
        ["A searchable list of application commands. Each item carries a title, a description and keywords, and runs an ICommand."]="可搜索的应用命令列表。每一项都带标题、描述与关键词，并执行一个 ICommand。",
        ["A segmented code field. Typing, pasting and the direct APIs all drive the same state, including masking and the error presentation."]="分段式验证码输入框。键入、粘贴与直接 API 都驱动同一份状态，包括掩码与错误呈现。",
        ["A select whose options are produced by a query. Typing filters; committing a choice reports the selected value."]="选项由查询生成的选择器。输入即过滤；确认选择后上报所选值。",
        ["A set of indeterminate loading figures for when a progress indicator would overstate how much is known."]="一组不确定加载图形，适用于进度指示器会夸大已知信息程度的场景。",
        ["A shimmering placeholder that occupies the same space as the content it stands in for, so nothing jumps when loading finishes."]="闪烁的占位内容，占据与真实内容相同的空间，因此加载完成时不会跳动。",
        ["A simple dialog offers a short list of choices and nothing else — no text body, no action buttons beyond cancelling."]="简单对话框只提供一小组选项，别无其他 —— 没有正文文本，除取消外也没有操作按钮。",
        ["A slider with two handles and a stepped span between them. Both handles are keyboard reachable and the value indicators follow the active handle."]="带两个滑块与分段区间的滑块控件。两个滑块都可通过键盘访问，数值指示跟随当前活动的滑块。",
        ["A star rating with fractional precision. Each half-star is its own target, so the hit test follows the visual rather than the spacing."]="支持小数精度的星级评分。每半颗星都是独立目标，因此命中测试跟随视觉而非间距。",
        ["A stepper walks through an ordered flow, reporting the active step and when the last one is confirmed."]="步骤条按顺序推进流程，上报当前步骤以及最后一步被确认的时机。",
        ["A text field that filters a list as you type. Filtering and keyboard selection are the native Avalonia behaviours; only the Material presentation is added."]="输入时即时过滤列表的文本框。过滤与键盘选择沿用 Avalonia 原生行为，此处只增加 Material 外观。",
        ["A thin outline-variant line groups related content in lists and containers."]="一条细的轮廓色分隔线，用于在列表与容器中归组相关内容。",
        ["A tile presents a media item with a footer bar that can carry its own title, subtitle and trailing action."]="磁贴用于展示媒体项，底部栏可承载自己的标题、副标题与尾部操作。",
        ["A virtualized hierarchy with keyboard navigation. Left/Right collapse and expand, Enter invokes, and the direct APIs reveal and select by id."]="带键盘导航的虚拟化层级结构。左/右方向键收起与展开，Enter 触发，直接 API 可按 id 展开并选中。",
        ["AXAML and C#"]="AXAML 与 C#",
        ["Active and stop indicators use Primary; the track uses SecondaryContainer. Value, Minimum, Maximum, and IsIndeterminate retain native ProgressBar semantics."]="活动与停止指示使用 Primary，轨道使用 SecondaryContainer。Value、Minimum、Maximum 与 IsIndeterminate 保留原生 ProgressBar 语义。",
        ["Add the theme after MaterialTheme and keep using Dock as usual - the package carries Dock.Avalonia and Dock.Avalonia.Themes.Fluent, and DockFluentTheme must not be included as well. This demo registers it in the page's own styles rather than in the application's."]="把主题加在 MaterialTheme 之后，然后照常使用 Dock —— 该包已携带 Dock.Avalonia 与 Dock.Avalonia.Themes.Fluent，因此不能再额外引入 DockFluentTheme。此示例把主题注册在页面自身的样式中，而不是应用级。",
        ["An about dialog carries application identity and leads into a searchable license list, which comes back to it."]="关于对话框承载应用标识，并可进入可搜索的许可列表，随后返回原处。",
        ["An expressive morphing shape communicates an indeterminate wait without showing exact progress."]="以表现力的变形形状传达不确定等待，而不显示确切进度。",
        ["An identity surface. Here each avatar is the actionable target that assigns the review, not decoration beside one."]="身份展示区域。这里每个头像都是分配评审的可操作目标，而不是旁边的装饰。",
        ["An incrementally loading collection. The page provider is async by contract, so the loading state is observable rather than skipped in one dispatcher pass."]="增量加载的集合。分页提供器按约定是异步的，因此加载状态是可观察的，而不会在一次调度中被跳过。",
        ["An ordered sequence of states. Each entry carries a title, a detail line, an optional timestamp, and a completed/active/neutral state."]="按顺序排列的状态序列。每一项都带标题、详情行、可选时间戳，以及已完成、进行中或中性状态。",
        ["An outline defines the boundary without elevation."]="描边在不使用投影的情况下界定边界。",
        ["Android Material 3 preference cards for building system-like settings, account preferences, and configuration dashboards with leading badge icons and trailing switches/actions."]="Android Material 3 偏好卡片，用于构建类似系统的设置、账户偏好与配置面板，带头部徽标图标与尾部开关或操作。",
        ["Animated visibility (Expand / Collapse)"]="动画可见性（展开 / 收起）",
        ["Avalonia DataGrid · Material themed"]="Avalonia DataGrid · Material 主题",
        ["AvaloniaRichEditor, themed"]="AvaloniaRichEditor，已套用主题",
        ["Badges show notification counts or status on icons and destinations."]="徽标在图标与导航目标上显示通知数量或状态。",
        ["Both rows contain the same controls. Only the second is inside a compact scope."]="两行包含相同的控件，只有第二行处于紧凑作用域内。",
        ["Bottom and side sheets present supplementary content while preserving the current context."]="底部与侧边面板在保留当前上下文的同时呈现补充内容。",
        ["Bottom app bar — compatibility"]="底部应用栏 — 兼容性",
        ["Breadcrumb with icons and slash separator"]="带图标与斜杠分隔符的面包屑",
        ["Breadcrumbs display the current location within a hierarchy and enable fast multi-level navigation back to parent destinations."]="面包屑显示当前在层级中的位置，并可快速多级返回上级目标。",
        ["Checkboxes let users select one or more items, or turn an item on or off."]="复选框用于选择一个或多个项目，或开关某一项。",
        ["Children enter one after another on a fixed item delay. PlayAsync replays the whole sequence and completes when it finishes."]="子元素按固定间隔依次入场。PlayAsync 会重播整段序列，并在结束时完成。",
        ["Chips produced from typed text. Enter or comma commits, Backspace removes the last chip from an empty editor, and a validator can reject a tag before it is added."]="由输入文本生成的标签块。Enter 或逗号提交；编辑器为空时 Backspace 删除最后一个标签块；校验器可在标签加入前拒绝它。",
        ["Click a settings card to trigger its preference action."]="点击设置卡片即可触发其偏好操作。",
        ["Click an empty label to inspect the stable 150 ms animation, or right-click any editable field for the localized Material editing menu."]="点击空标签可查看稳定的 150 毫秒动画，或右键任意可编辑字段以打开本地化的 Material 编辑菜单。",
        ["Click any breadcrumb segment to navigate to it."]="点击任意面包屑分段即可跳转到该层级。",
        ["Click any segment to select it."]="点击任意分段即可选中。",
        ["Click the card below to see the Material 3 Container Transform morphing transition between card trigger and expanded surface."]="点击下方卡片，查看 Material 3 容器变换在卡片触发器与展开表面之间的变形过渡。",
        ["Click the segmented field, type or paste six digits, then use the direct APIs to exercise masking, errors and completion."]="点击分段输入框，键入或粘贴六位数字，然后使用直接 API 验证掩码、错误与完成状态。",
        ["Click-triggered floating toolbar"]="点击触发的浮动工具栏",
        ["Clicking a parent segment navigates to it and drops everything below, which is what a breadcrumb is for. The trailing segment is the current location: it has no hover state and no hand cursor."]="点击上级分段会跳转到该层级并丢弃其下的全部内容，这正是面包屑的用途。末尾分段代表当前位置：没有悬停状态，也不显示手型光标。",
        ["Color roles, corner scale, typography and motion update without replacing control templates."]="颜色角色、圆角层级、排版与动效都会更新，而无需替换控件模板。",
        ["Compact actions, filters, entered values, and dynamically generated suggestions."]="紧凑的操作、筛选条件、已输入值与动态生成的建议。",
        ["Complete screens assembled from the components above."]="由上述组件组装而成的完整界面。",
        ["Components are interactive building blocks for creating a user interface. They can be organized into categories based on their purpose: action, containment, communication, navigation, selection, and text input."]="组件是构建用户界面的可交互积木，可按用途分为操作、容器、沟通、导航、选择与文本输入等类别。",
        ["Container transform (Open Container)"]="容器变换（打开容器）",
        ["Continuous vertical indexes with expressive segmented styling, flexible slots, and native selection."]="连续的纵向索引，具备表现力的分段样式、灵活插槽与原生选择能力。",
        ["Create one MdSnackbarService at the composition root, assign it to the visual MdSnackbarHost, and inject the same instance as IMdSnackbarService into view models. Creating an unattached MdSnackbar control cannot render."]="在组合根处创建一个 MdSnackbarService，将其赋给可视的 MdSnackbarHost，并把同一实例以 IMdSnackbarService 注入视图模型。创建未挂载的 MdSnackbar 控件无法渲染。",
        ["Default, toggle, split, standard group and connected group configurations."]="默认、切换、拆分、标准分组与连体分组等配置。",
        ["Density is an attached property, so a compact scope applies to one subtree and leaves the rest of the page at the default spacing."]="密度是附加属性，因此紧凑作用域只影响一个子树，页面其余部分保持默认间距。",
        ["Dialogs interrupt a flow with an important prompt. MdDialogHost can select predeclared AXAML templates by model type and supports awaitable direct usage."]="对话框会以重要提示打断当前流程。MdDialogHost 可按模型类型选择预先声明的 AXAML 模板，也支持可等待的直接调用。",
        ["Displays large, medium, and 40–56dp small keyline items. Tapping invokes content without changing its size; sizes advance only with scrolling or controller navigation."]="展示大、中以及 40–56dp 的小关键线项。点击只触发内容而不改变尺寸；尺寸仅在滚动或控制器导航时推进。",
        ["Docked and floating toolbars keep frequently used actions close to page content."]="停靠与浮动工具栏让常用操作贴近页面内容。",
        ["Drag the divider, or focus the comparison and use the arrow keys — Shift for a coarser step."]="拖动分隔条，或聚焦对比区域后使用方向键 — 按住 Shift 可加大步进。",
        ["Each swatch keeps a 48-DIP target and opens the same picker on an elevated Material surface."]="每个色块保持 48 DIP 目标尺寸，并在带投影的 Material 表面上打开同一个取色器。",
        ["Elevated, filled, and outlined cards group related content and actions with a 12-DIP shape."]="投影、填充与描边卡片以 12 DIP 圆角将相关内容与操作归组。",
        ["Escape and optional scrim click dismiss the active dialog. Only one modal dialog is active; Dialog stores its current view model and Avalonia selects the matching template. ShowAsync returns the value supplied to Close(result)."]="Escape 与可选的遮罩点击会关闭当前对话框。同一时刻只有一个模态对话框处于活动状态；Dialog 保存当前视图模型，由 Avalonia 选择匹配的模板。ShowAsync 返回传给 Close(result) 的值。",
        ["Expansion panels edit lightweight settings in place. AllowMultiple decides whether opening one closes the others."]="展开面板就地编辑轻量设置。AllowMultiple 决定打开一个时是否关闭其他面板。",
        ["Extended client-area chrome keeps the platform resize frame, shadow and corner treatment while Material owns the caption content. This is a true chromeless client window: Material owns the surface, title bar, caption buttons and resize affordances without a second native title-bar line."]="扩展客户区窗口保留平台的调整边框、阴影与圆角处理，标题内容则由 Material 负责。这是真正的无原生边框客户窗口：Material 掌管表面、标题栏、标题按钮与调整大小的交互区，不再出现第二条原生标题栏。",
        ["FABs represent the most important action on a screen; FAB menus expose two to six related actions with left or right alignment."]="FAB 代表界面上最重要的操作；FAB 菜单可展示两到六个相关操作，并支持左对齐或右对齐。",
        ["Flexible · horizontal destinations"]="灵活 · 横向目标",
        ["Focus, shortcut and Hero"]="焦点、快捷键与 Hero",
        ["For hosts that already own an editing engine. This instance uses the bundled TextBox adapter."]="面向已经自带编辑引擎的宿主。此实例使用内置的 TextBox 适配器。",
        ["From a view model, with no control reference"]="从视图模型调用，不持有控件引用",
        ["Generate an HCT-based Material 3 color system from any seed. Tune mode, contrast, palette strategy, motion, typography and shape, then export the configuration as JSON."]="从任意种子颜色生成基于 HCT 的 Material 3 配色系统。调整模式、对比度、色板策略、动效、排版与形状，然后以 JSON 导出配置。",
        ["Hero variant allocates maximum container focus to one dominant item."]="Hero 变体把容器的最大注意力分配给一个主导项。",
        ["Home destination content is active."]="首页目标内容已激活。",
        ["Home summary in the simulated medium viewport."]="模拟中等视口中的首页摘要。",
        ["Horizontal collections reveal images, video, or labeled destinations while preserving native selection, gesture snapping, and keyboard navigation."]="横向集合可展示图片、视频或带标签的目标，同时保留原生选择、手势吸附与键盘导航。",
        ["Hover or focus the anchor, then move away to dismiss."]="悬停或聚焦锚点，然后移开即可关闭。",
        ["Independent Material pickers with two-way values, keyboard dismissal, and scoped popup surfaces."]="独立的 Material 选择器，支持双向取值、键盘关闭与作用域化的弹出表面。",
        ["Install the library, merge its opt-in Material theme, and add your first independent Md control."]="安装库、合并其可选 Material 主题，并添加第一个独立的 Md 控件。",
        ["Interactive cards expose Click and Command. Set IsInteractive=False for a presentation-only card that is skipped by keyboard focus."]="可交互卡片暴露 Click 与 Command。将 IsInteractive 设为 False 可得到仅展示卡片，键盘焦点会跳过它。",
        ["IsActive pauses rendering work. The inherited MdMotion scheme reduces or disables decorative movement."]="IsActive 可暂停渲染工作。继承而来的 MdMotion 方案会减少或禁用装饰性动效。",
        ["Linear and circular indicators report determinate progress or an indeterminate ongoing process."]="线性与环形指示器可报告确定进度，或表示持续进行中的不确定过程。",
        ["MVVM first"]="MVVM 优先",
        ["MVVM service usage"]="MVVM 服务用法",
        ["Material color roles, type scale, shape and motion are exposed as dynamic resources rather than global native-control overrides."]="Material 颜色角色、字号层级、形状与动效以动态资源形式暴露，而不是全局改写原生控件样式。",
        ["MdAdaptiveLayout picks compact, medium, or expanded content from its own measured width, not from the window. Resize the gallery to cross the breakpoints below."]="MdAdaptiveLayout 依据自身测量宽度而不是窗口宽度选择紧凑、中等或展开内容。调整示例窗口即可跨越下面的断点。",
        ["MdBeforeAfter wipes one layer over another along a draggable divider. Both layers take any content, so the same control compares two photos, two renders, or two laid-out panels."]="MdBeforeAfter 沿可拖动分隔条在一层内容上擦出另一层。两层都可承载任意内容，因此同一控件可对比两张照片、两次渲染结果或两个布局面板。",
        ["MdComboBox implements Material's exposed dropdown menu while retaining Avalonia selection and keyboard behavior."]="MdComboBox 实现 Material 的外露下拉菜单，同时保留 Avalonia 的选择与键盘行为。",
        ["MdDataGrid · Material table"]="MdDataGrid · Material 表格",
        ["MdForm validates its fields together and reports one result. Autovalidate decides whether errors appear as the user types or only on submit."]="MdForm 会一起校验其字段并给出单一结果。Autovalidate 决定错误是在输入过程中出现，还是仅在提交时出现。",
        ["MdRichEditor command surface"]="MdRichEditor 命令面板",
        ["MdScrollViewer is the Material scrolling surface used by every page in this gallery. It themes the scrollbar and overscroll without restyling Avalonia's ScrollViewer globally."]="MdScrollViewer 是本示例每个页面使用的 Material 滚动表面。它为滚动条与过度滚动提供主题，而不会全局改写 Avalonia 的 ScrollViewer 样式。",
        ["MdSurface paints a semantic container role with optional elevation; MdText picks a role from the M3 type scale. Both follow the active theme rather than hard-coded colours or font sizes."]="MdSurface 绘制语义化容器角色并可选带投影；MdText 从 M3 字号层级中选取角色。两者都跟随当前主题，而不是硬编码颜色或字号。",
        ["MdSwitch derives from ToggleButton, so IsChecked, Command, keyboard input, focus and automation remain available for MVVM and direct control usage."]="MdSwitch 派生自 ToggleButton，因此 IsChecked、Command、键盘输入、焦点与自动化在 MVVM 与直接控制场景下依然可用。",
        ["MdTabs is the bar on its own; MdTabsView holds the pages and follows it."]="MdTabs 只是标签栏本身；MdTabsView 承载页面并跟随它。",
        ["Medium viewport · navigation rail · Home destination."]="中等视口 · 导航侧栏 · 首页目标。",
        ["Navigation bars provide three to five top-level destinations on compact and medium layouts."]="导航栏在紧凑与中等布局下提供三到五个顶级目标。",
        ["Navigation destinations change real content; the suite can be driven across compact, medium and expanded breakpoints without resizing the operating-system window."]="导航目标会切换真实内容；整套示例可在紧凑、中等与展开断点之间驱动，无需调整操作系统窗口大小。",
        ["No contextual action selected."]="未选择上下文操作。",
        ["Official Material Design 3 motion system: Container Transform (morph), Shared Axis, Fade Through, Animated Visibility, expressive spring schemes, and pointer ripples."]="官方 Material Design 3 动效系统：容器变换（变形）、共享轴、淡入淡出、动画可见性、表现力弹簧方案与指针涟漪。",
        ["One group, two modes. Single selection behaves like a radio set; AllowMultiple turns the same group into independent toggles."]="一个分组，两种模式。单选行为类似单选组；AllowMultiple 会把同一分组变成相互独立的开关。",
        ["One task rendered under two platform policies. The switches choose between following the host platform and forcing Cupertino metrics."]="同一任务在两种平台策略下渲染。开关用于在跟随宿主平台与强制 Cupertino 度量之间切换。",
        ["Open a menu by clicking the field or pressing Alt+Down. Arrow keys change the active option; Enter commits selection and Escape dismisses the popup."]="点击输入框或按 Alt+Down 打开菜单。方向键切换当前选项；Enter 确认选择，Escape 关闭弹出层。",
        ["Open the palette and run a command, or filter by keyword."]="打开面板执行命令，或按关键词过滤。",
        ["Open the popover, then scroll to verify it dismisses."]="打开弹出框，然后滚动以验证它会自动关闭。",
        ["Plain tooltips label controls; rich tooltips provide persistent contextual details and actions."]="普通工具提示用于标注控件；富工具提示提供持续的上下文详情与操作。",
        ["Position is two-way bindable: the slider and the divider drive each other."]="位置支持双向绑定：滑块与分隔条互相驱动。",
        ["Press Escape to cancel, Enter to confirm input-mode time, and Tab to move between picker actions. Popup state and selected values support two-way MVVM binding."]="按 Escape 取消，按 Enter 确认输入模式下的时间，按 Tab 在选择器操作之间移动。弹出状态与所选值都支持双向 MVVM 绑定。",
        ["Pull the list down, or call BeginRefresh, and the host completes the gesture when its work is done."]="下拉列表，或调用 BeginRefresh；宿主会在其工作完成后结束该手势。",
        ["Radio buttons select one option from a mutually exclusive set."]="单选按钮在互斥选项集中选择一个选项。",
        ["Resize the Gallery. The control chooses compact, medium, or expanded content from its own width."]="调整示例窗口大小。控件会根据自身宽度选择紧凑、中等或展开内容。",
        ["Rows can be dragged, moved with Ctrl+Up and Ctrl+Down, or moved through the direct API. Every move reports where the item came from and went."]="行可以拖动、用 Ctrl+Up 与 Ctrl+Down 移动，或通过直接 API 移动。每次移动都会上报项目的原位置与新位置。",
        ["Secondary tabs with a content area"]="带内容区的次级标签",
        ["Select a curated source, inspect its HCT tonal palette, or fine-tune HSV and opacity values."]="选择预设来源、查看其 HCT 色调色板，或微调 HSV 与不透明度。",
        ["Select a simulated viewport. Auto mode swaps bar → rail → drawer at 600 and 1000 dp."]="选择一个模拟视口。自动模式在 600 与 1000 dp 处依次切换为导航栏 → 侧栏 → 抽屉。",
        ["Select content, then open the contextual toolbar."]="先选择内容，再打开上下文工具栏。",
        ["Set ShowButtonSpinner to false to keep the numeric parsing and clamping while typing is the only way in."]="将 ShowButtonSpinner 设为 false，可在只允许键入输入的同时保留数值解析与范围限制。",
        ["Set Variant to Powerline for the interlocking wedge segments used by terminal prompts. Each segment ends in an arrow that slots into the notch of the next one, so the strip reads as one continuous ribbon. Colours stay on Material 3 roles rather than terminal ANSI colours, and the selected segment takes the primary role."]="将 Variant 设为 Powerline 即可得到终端提示符使用的互锁楔形分段。每个分段末端是箭头，正好嵌入下一分段的缺口，使整条呈现为连续带状。配色沿用 Material 3 角色而非终端 ANSI 颜色，选中分段使用 Primary 角色。",
        ["Settings group with interactive cards"]="带可交互卡片的设置分组",
        ["Simulate a virtual keyboard inset to verify that the host automatically adjusts viewport bottom padding and scrolls focused text controls into view."]="模拟虚拟键盘内边距，验证宿主会自动调整视口底部内边距，并把获得焦点的文本控件滚动到可见区域。",
        ["Sliders select a value from a continuous or discrete range while retaining keyboard and pointer input."]="滑块在连续或离散区间中取值，同时保留键盘与指针输入。",
        ["Slots, prefix/suffix and error"]="插槽、前缀/后缀与错误",
        ["Small badges are 6 DIP. Large badges are 16 DIP high, use the Error/OnError roles, and expand horizontally for multiple characters."]="小徽标为 6 DIP。大徽标高 16 DIP，使用 Error/OnError 配色，并随字符增多横向扩展。",
        ["Snackbars briefly report an app process and may offer one action or a close affordance."]="Snackbar 用于简短汇报应用进程，可提供一个操作或关闭方式。",
        ["Standard and modal drawers expose top-level destinations on larger or temporarily constrained layouts."]="标准抽屉与模态抽屉在更大或临时受限的布局中展示顶级目标。",
        ["Standard, filled, tonal, and outlined variants across five expressive sizes."]="标准、填充、色调与描边变体，覆盖五种表现尺寸。",
        ["Subtle shadow separates this card from its background."]="轻微投影使卡片与背景分离。",
        ["Swipe a row either way to dismiss it, with a different background behind each direction. Restore puts it back."]="向任意方向滑动即可移除该行，每个方向背后是不同的背景。恢复按钮可将其放回。",
        ["Swipe the row, or press Restore."]="滑动该行，或点击恢复。",
        ["Switches immediately toggle a single setting on or off."]="开关用于即时开启或关闭单个设置项。",
        ["Tables, grids, paging, and charts."]="表格、数据网格、分页与图表。",
        ["Tabs organize peer content across screens and views while retaining native selection and keyboard navigation."]="标签用于在不同界面与视图之间组织同级内容，同时保留原生选择与键盘导航。",
        ["Tap any setting item or toggle a switch to interact."]="点击任意设置项或切换开关即可交互。",
        ["Temporary surfaces expose a concise list of choices with optional leading and trailing content."]="临时表面以简洁列表呈现选项，并可选带头部与尾部内容。",
        ["Text that reveals itself. Each effect runs over a fixed duration rather than a per-character tick, so the total time is predictable."]="逐字显现的文本。每个动效按固定时长运行，而不是逐字符步进，因此总时长可预期。",
        ["The 18-DIP checkbox stays inside a 40-DIP state layer and a 48-DIP hit target. Tab reveals the keyboard focus indicator; click cycles native Avalonia CheckBox state."]="18 DIP 的复选框位于 40 DIP 状态层与 48 DIP 命中目标之内。Tab 显示键盘焦点指示；点击循环切换 Avalonia 原生 CheckBox 状态。",
        ["The M3 motion system, theming, icons, and animated extras."]="M3 动效系统、主题、图标与动画扩展。",
        ["The complete Google Material Symbols Rounded catalog. Click a tile to copy a ready-to-paste AXAML MdSymbols reference."]="完整的 Google Material Symbols Rounded 图标目录。点击磁贴可复制可直接粘贴的 AXAML MdSymbols 引用。",
        ["The docked date picker commits as you pick: its bound value changes the moment you choose a day. Everything that opens as a dialog — the modal date picker and both time pickers — is provisional: the value changes only when you confirm with OK, or Enter in input mode. Dismissing with Escape, the scrim, or Cancel restores the value the picker held when it opened. Each picker below prints its live bound value, so you can see which rule applied."]="停靠式日期选择器即选即提交：绑定值在你选中某天的瞬间就改变。所有以对话框形式打开的选择器 —— 模态日期选择器与两个时间选择器 —— 都是暂态的：只有点击确定，或在输入模式下按 Enter 才会改变取值。用 Escape、遮罩或取消关闭时，会恢复打开选择器时的取值。下面每个选择器都会打印其实时绑定值，便于确认生效的是哪条规则。",
        ["The full 48-DIP target responds to mouse, touch, pen and keyboard input. Native Avalonia GroupName, command and automation semantics remain available."]="完整的 48 DIP 目标区域可响应鼠标、触摸、手写笔与键盘输入。Avalonia 原生的 GroupName、命令与自动化语义依然可用。",
        ["The handle resizes the sheet between its minimum and maximum extent; nested wheel input expands or collapses it at the scroll boundaries."]="拖动手柄可在最小与最大高度之间调整面板；嵌套的滚轮输入会在滚动边界处展开或收起它。",
        ["The host pads its viewport by the virtual keyboard inset and scrolls the focused text control into the space that is left."]="宿主按虚拟键盘内边距压缩视口，并把获得焦点的文本控件滚动到剩余空间中。",
        ["The left menu starts open and expands up; the right menu opens on click and expands down. IsInitiallyOpen controls only the first attachment, while IsOpen remains the bindable live state."]="左侧菜单默认展开且向上弹出；右侧菜单点击后打开并向下弹出。IsInitiallyOpen 只控制首次挂载，IsOpen 才是可绑定的实时状态。",
        ["The preview uses Material Color Utilities instead of approximating roles by adding RGB values."]="预览使用 Material Color Utilities 计算，而不是通过叠加 RGB 值来近似各角色。",
        ["The rich example also opens on click and dismisses with Escape or an outside press."]="富示例也支持点击打开，并可用 Escape 或点击外部关闭。",
        ["This one is display-only: IsInteractive is false, so it is not a tab stop and neither the pointer nor the arrow keys move it."]="此示例仅用于展示：IsInteractive 为 false，因此不参与 Tab 焦点循环，指针与方向键都无法移动它。",
        ["This panel's DataContext is a plain view model that was handed an IMdDialogService and nothing else. It names the dialog by model object and awaits the answer; the host resolves the view and the result comes back as a value."]="此面板的 DataContext 是一个普通视图模型，只被注入了 IMdDialogService。它按模型对象指定对话框并等待结果；视图由宿主解析，结果以值的形式返回。",
        ["Top app bars provide navigation, screen identity, and contextual actions."]="顶部应用栏提供导航、界面标识与上下文操作。",
        ["Two different answers to tabular data. MdDataGrid is a Material table with filtering, sorting and editable cells; the stock Avalonia DataGrid wearing the Md3.Avalonia.DataGrid theme is the full spreadsheet control."]="面向表格数据的两种不同答案。MdDataGrid 是带筛选、排序与可编辑单元格的 Material 表格；套用 Md3.Avalonia.DataGrid 主题的原生 Avalonia DataGrid 则是完整的电子表格控件。",
        ["Two linked date fields that validate against each other, with localized month and weekday names from the active gallery language."]="两个互相校验的联动日期字段，月份与星期名称按当前示例语言本地化。",
        ["Two lists and the moves between them. Rows can be dragged across one or several at a time, or moved with the arrow actions."]="两个列表与其间的移动操作。行可以拖动，一次移动一个或多个，也可以用箭头操作移动。",
        ["Two routes to rich text. Md3.Avalonia.RichEditor is an opt-in package that skins the AvaloniaRichEditor control library with Material tokens; MdRichEditor is the engine-free command surface in the core library, which leaves the document to an adapter."]="通往富文本的两条路径。Md3.Avalonia.RichEditor 是选装包，用 Material 令牌为 AvaloniaRichEditor 控件库换肤；MdRichEditor 则是核心库中不依赖引擎的命令层，把文档交给适配器。",
        ["Uniform item sizing scrolling freely without focal shape transitions."]="项目尺寸统一，可自由滚动，没有焦点形状过渡。",
        ["Usage: install Md3.Avalonia.RichEditor, then add <themes:MaterialRichEditorTheme /> to Application.Styles after MaterialTheme. The package carries the AvaloniaRichEditor dependency so the core packages do not."]="用法：安装 Md3.Avalonia.RichEditor，然后在 Application.Styles 中把 <themes:MaterialRichEditorTheme /> 加在 MaterialTheme 之后。该包携带 AvaloniaRichEditor 依赖，核心包因此无需携带。",
        ["Use the same controls with CommunityToolkit.MVVM bindings or direct event-driven code on desktop and Android."]="在桌面与 Android 上使用同一套控件，既可搭配 CommunityToolkit.MVVM 绑定，也可直接使用事件驱动代码。",
        ["Vertical, with a thicker divider"]="纵向排列，分隔条更粗",
        ["Virtual keyboard inactive (height: 0dp)."]="虚拟键盘未激活（高度：0dp）。",
        ["When a selection is committed"]="选择被确认时",
        ["When you need the full spreadsheet control — column resizing and reordering, frozen columns, grouping, auto-generated columns — use Avalonia's own DataGrid with the opt-in Md3.Avalonia.DataGrid theme package. This one is the stock control; only the theme is ours."]="当你需要完整的电子表格能力 —— 列宽调整与重排、冻结列、分组、自动生成列 —— 请使用 Avalonia 自带的 DataGrid 并选装 Md3.Avalonia.DataGrid 主题包。这里是原生控件，只有主题是我们的。",

        // MdWaveform gallery page (2026-10-16).
        ["Waveform"]="波形图",
        ["Waterfall"]="瀑布流",
        ["A masonry layout: every child goes into whichever column is currently shortest, so cards of different heights pack without the ragged gaps a grid leaves behind. The order is never rearranged - a feed's order is its content, and reordering it to save a few pixels would misrepresent it."]="瀑布流布局：每个子元素都放进当前最短的那一列，因此高度不一的卡片可以紧凑排列，不会留下网格布局那样的参差空隙。顺序永远不会被重排——信息流的顺序就是内容本身，为了省下几个像素而重排它就是对内容的歪曲。",
        ["Derived columns"]="自动推导列数",
        ["No column count is set here. The panel divides the width it is given by MinColumnWidth and uses as many columns as fit, so this same markup is one column on a phone and four on a desktop with no breakpoint. Resize the window and the count follows. It also never reserves more columns than there are children."]="这里没有设置列数。面板用所得宽度除以 MinColumnWidth，取能放下的列数，因此同一份标记在手机上是一列、在桌面上是四列，不需要任何断点。拖动窗口改变尺寸，列数会跟着变。它也不会保留比子元素数量更多的列。",
        ["Fixed columns"]="固定列数",
        ["Setting Columns pins the count and MinColumnWidth is ignored, which is what a layout that has to line up with something else wants. ColumnSpacing and ItemSpacing are independent, so the gutters need not be square."]="设置 Columns 可以固定列数，此时 MinColumnWidth 被忽略——需要与别处对齐的布局正需要这一点。ColumnSpacing 与 ItemSpacing 相互独立，因此间距不必是正方形。",
        ["From a collection"]="由集合驱动",
        ["MdWaterfall is the same panel behind an items control, for a feed bound to a collection rather than one written out by hand. The panel reads its column settings back off the control, so there is no ItemsPanelTemplate to write."]="MdWaterfall 是同一个面板套在 items control 之外，用于绑定到集合的信息流，而不是手写子元素。面板会反过来从控件读取列设置，因此不需要自己编写 ItemsPanelTemplate。",
        ["While it plays"]="播放时",
        ["IsPulsing makes the bars pulse in place, so the same peak buffer reads as a track that is playing rather than a picture of one. The pulse travels along the bars and is scaled by each bar's own peak, so a quiet passage stays quiet instead of thumping as loudly as the drop; AnimationAmplitude and AnimationSpeed shape it. It runs on the render loop rather than a timer, so a waveform that is hidden or switched off costs nothing, and it holds still under the Reduced and None motion schemes. The waveform above pulses while the demo track is playing, and its playhead carries a knob that grows while it is held, the way a Material slider's handle does."]="IsPulsing 会让音条在原位起伏，于是同一份峰值数据看起来就是正在播放的曲目，而不是一张曲目的图片。起伏沿音条推进，并按每根音条自身的峰值缩放，因此安静的段落依然安静，不会和副歌一样猛；AnimationAmplitude 与 AnimationSpeed 用来调节幅度与速度。它跑在渲染循环上而不是计时器上，所以被隐藏或关闭的波形不产生任何开销，并且在 Reduced 与 None 动效方案下保持静止。上面那条波形会在示例音频播放时起伏，它的播放头带有一个在按住时变大的圆柄，与 Material 滑块的滑块柄一致。",
        ["A peak-driven waveform: the played part in Primary, the rest in SurfaceContainerHighest, the same split a Material 3 slider makes between its active and inactive track. The control draws peaks and does not decode audio, so the host keeps its own decoder, threading and buffer lifetime."]="由峰值驱动的波形图：已播放部分使用 Primary，其余使用 SurfaceContainerHighest，与 Material 3 滑块在活动轨道与非活动轨道之间的划分一致。控件只绘制峰值，不解码音频，因此解码器、线程与缓冲区生命周期仍由宿主掌握。",
        ["The peaks here are not invented. They are decoded from a real 20-second recording bundled with the gallery, read as plain PCM by a small WAV reader rather than drawn from a curve written to look like audio. Nothing reaches an audio device either: playback is a timer walking the playhead through the decoded samples, so it behaves the same on a machine with no output at all. The track is a 20-second excerpt of Okay from mdn/dom-examples, dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0."]="这里的峰值不是凭空生成的。它们解码自随 Gallery 打包的真实 20 秒录音，由一个小型 WAV 读取器按普通 PCM 解析，而不是用一条看起来像音频的曲线画出来的。同样也不会向音频设备输出任何内容：所谓播放只是一个计时器在已解码的采样上推进播放头，因此在完全没有音频输出的机器上表现一致。曲目为取自 mdn/dom-examples 的《Okay》20 秒选段，以 CC0 1.0 献给公有领域。",
        ["Scrubbing"]="拖动定位",
        ["Drag anywhere to seek, or focus the waveform and use the arrow keys, Home and End. Position is two-way bindable, so a player view model drives the playhead during playback and receives seeks back."]="在任意位置拖动即可定位，或聚焦波形后使用方向键、Home 与 End。位置支持双向绑定，因此播放器的视图模型可在播放时驱动播放头，并接收回传的定位。",
        ["Level history"]="电平历史",
        ["IsMirrored=false grows the bars up from the bottom instead of around the centre line, which reads as a level history rather than a waveform. Same control, same tokens, no separate meter."]="IsMirrored=false 让条形自底部向上生长，而不是围绕中线对称，读起来是电平历史而非波形。同一个控件、同一套令牌，无需单独的仪表控件。",
        ["Display only"]="仅展示",
        ["IsInteractive=false keeps the shape without the scrub: no pointer capture and no tab stop, for a waveform that only reports where playback is."]="IsInteractive=false 保留形状但不支持拖动：不捕获指针，也不参与 Tab 焦点循环，适用于只报告播放位置的波形。",
        ["With no peaks yet the control draws just its baseline, so a page can lay the space out before the host has produced anything to draw."]="还没有峰值时，控件只绘制中线基准，因此页面可以先占好位置，等宿主产出可绘制的内容。",
["Floating window"]="悬浮窗口",["Signature pad"]="手写签名板",["Sign here"]="在此签名",["The bare canvas, styled by the entry point"]="仅用画布：由入口方法美化",["Sign above the line"]="在线上方签名",["A handwriting surface with the chrome a signature needs around it: a baseline to sign on, a hint that disappears the moment there is ink, a clear button, and an eraser. Draw in the panel below with a pointer, a pen or a finger - the strokes are smoothed and can carry pressure, and they follow the theme, so the ink is on-surface rather than the red the underlying canvas defaults to."]="带签名所需外壳的手写面：一条签名基线、有墨迹后随即消失的提示、清除按钮，以及橡皮擦。在下面的面板里用指针、触控笔或手指书写——笔迹会被平滑处理并支持压感，并且跟随主题，所以墨水取自 on-surface，而不是底层画布默认的红色。",["The strokes themselves are drawn by DotNetCampus.AvaloniaInkCanvas, which renders them with Skia. What the Material package adds is everything upstream leaves to the host: it defaults to red ink ten units thick, has no baseline, no empty state and no way to start over, and none of those are a Material decision."]="笔迹本身由 DotNetCampus.AvaloniaInkCanvas 用 Skia 绘制。Material 包补的是上游留给宿主的那部分：它默认是 10 单位粗的红墨水，没有基线、没有空状态、也没有重新开始的办法，而这些都不是 Material 该做的决定。",["The clear button is part of the control. Erase is a mode: switch to it and the baseline fades, because there is nothing to sign on while you are removing."]="清除按钮是控件的一部分。擦除是一种模式：切过去之后基线会变淡，因为正在擦除时无从签起。",["An application that wants the strokes but not the signature chrome can keep using InkCanvas directly. It draws itself with Skia and registers no styles, so the theme reaches it the way it reaches a map or a plot: one call that writes the settings it draws with."]="只想要笔迹、不想要签名外壳的应用可以直接继续用 InkCanvas。它自绘、不注册任何样式，所以主题触达它的方式和触达地图、图表一样：一次调用，写入它绘制所用的设置。",["The theme is an opt-in package, so add it after MaterialTheme. MdSignaturePad raises StrokeCompleted when a stroke is committed, which is when a signature form becomes valid, and Cleared when it is emptied."]="该主题是 opt-in 包，请放在 MaterialTheme 之后。MdSignaturePad 会在笔迹落定时抛出 StrokeCompleted（此刻签名表单才算有效），在清空时抛出 Cleared。", ["A window that floats inside the application instead of above it. Drag it by the title bar, resize it from the lower-right corner, or collapse it to its title bar - the content stays mounted either way, so a hosted player keeps playing and an editor keeps its undo history. The page underneath stays reachable, which is the difference between this and a dialog."]="一个悬浮在应用内部、而不是应用之上的窗口。拖动标题栏移动它，拖动右下角改变大小，或把它收起成一条标题栏——无论哪种，内容都保持挂载，因此内嵌的播放器会继续播放，编辑器会保留撤销历史。页面其余部分依然可用，这正是它与对话框的区别。", ["It is deliberately not an operating-system window. A real window sits above the application, cannot be clipped by it and needs a compositor to move; this is a child that draws last, so it inherits the theme, the motion scheme and the accessibility tree of the page it floats over. The trade-off is that it is bounded by its host, and the control leans into that: dragging is clamped to the visual parent, so the window can be moved anywhere inside the panel below but never lost off it."]="它刻意不是操作系统窗口。真正的窗口位于应用之上，无法被应用裁剪，移动还需要合成器；而这只是一个最后绘制的子元素，因此它继承所在页面的主题、动效方案与无障碍树。代价是它被宿主限定，而控件正是利用这一点：拖动被限制在可视父级内，所以窗口可以在下方面板里任意移动，却不会丢失到面板之外。", ["A player, floating over the page"]="悬浮在页面上的播放器", ["Everything below is one page. The window is a sibling of the text it covers, so the surface takes the same corner and elevation tokens a dialog does, and it raises one level while the pointer is holding it. Try dragging it past an edge: it stops at the border rather than leaving the panel. Minimizing hides the content but leaves it mounted, so the track keeps its position and the waveform picks up where it stopped."]="下面所有内容都属于同一个页面。窗口只是它覆盖的文字的兄弟元素，因此这个表面使用与对话框相同的圆角与阴影令牌，并且在指针按住它时提升一级。试着把它拖过边缘：它会停在边框处，而不会离开面板。最小化会隐藏内容但保持挂载，因此曲目保留播放位置，波形也会从停下处继续。", ["The page underneath"]="下层的页面", ["This text is not disabled and not behind a scrim. It is simply covered, and moving the window uncovers it again."]="这段文字没有被禁用，也没有被遮罩挡住。它只是被盖住了，移动窗口就会重新露出来。", ["Because the window is a child of this panel rather than a separate window, it is clipped by the rounded border above it and it moves with the panel when the gallery is resized."]="由于窗口是这个面板的子元素而非独立窗口，它会被上方的圆角边框裁剪，并在 gallery 调整大小时随面板一起移动。", ["What it is not"]="它不是什么", ["This is not the operating-system Dynamic Island, and it does not try to be one. On iOS and Android that surface is drawn by the system above every application, so no toolkit can host it; what this gives you is the same idea one level down - a compact surface that stays out of the way, holds a little live content, and can be moved or collapsed by the person using the app."]="这不是操作系统的灵动岛，也没有试图成为灵动岛。在 iOS 与 Android 上，那个表面由系统在所有应用之上绘制，任何工具包都无法承载它；这里提供的是同一思路下移一层的版本——一个不碍事的紧凑表面，承载少量实时内容，并且可以由使用者移动或收起。", ["Capabilities"]="能力开关", ["CanDrag, CanResize, CanMinimize and CanClose each hide the affordance they name, for a host that wants a fixed panel rather than a window. Position is X and Y, and the control owns its Margin to realise them, so set the position through those two properties rather than through the margin."]="CanDrag、CanResize、CanMinimize 与 CanClose 各自隐藏对应的交互入口，供需要固定面板而非窗口的宿主使用。位置由 X 与 Y 决定，控件通过自身的 Margin 实现它们，所以请通过这两个属性设置位置，而不要直接设置 Margin。",

    };

    public static void Apply(Control root, CultureInfo culture)
    {
        var elements = new object[] { root }
            .Concat(root.GetLogicalDescendants().Cast<object>())
            .Concat(root.GetVisualDescendants().Cast<object>())
            .Distinct();
        foreach (var element in elements)
        {
            if (element is TextBlock text && text.Text is { } value)
            {
                var original = Originals.GetValue(text, _ => new Original(value)).Value;
                text.Text = Translate(original, culture);
            }
            else if (element is ContentControl content && content.Content is string label)
            {
                var original = Originals.GetValue(content, _ => new Original(label)).Value;
                content.Content = Translate(original, culture);
            }
            if (element is TextBox input && input.PlaceholderText is { } placeholder)
            {
                var original = PlaceholderOriginals.GetValue(input, _ => new Original(placeholder)).Value;
                input.PlaceholderText = Translate(original, culture);
            }
            if (element is MdTextBox field && field.Label is string fieldLabel)
            {
                var original = LabelOriginals.GetValue(field, _ => new Original(fieldLabel)).Value;
                field.Label = Translate(original, culture);
            }
            if (element is MdComboBox combo && combo.Label is string comboLabel)
            {
                var original = LabelOriginals.GetValue(combo, _ => new Original(comboLabel)).Value;
                combo.Label = Translate(original, culture);
            }
            if (element is MdCascader cascader)
            {
                if (cascader.Label is { } cascaderLabel)
                {
                    var original = LabelOriginals.GetValue(cascader, _ => new Original(cascaderLabel)).Value;
                    cascader.Label = Translate(original, culture);
                }
                if (cascader.PlaceholderText is { } cascaderPlaceholder)
                {
                    var original = PlaceholderOriginals.GetValue(cascader, _ => new Original(cascaderPlaceholder)).Value;
                    cascader.PlaceholderText = Translate(original, culture);
                }
            }
        }
    }

    public static string Choose(string english, string chinese) =>
        CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture.TwoLetterISOLanguageName == "zh" ? chinese : english;

    private static string Translate(string source, CultureInfo culture) =>
        culture.TwoLetterISOLanguageName == "zh" && Zh.TryGetValue(source, out var value) ? value : source;
}
